{"seq":23,"slug":"cross-cultural-management","title":"跨文化团队管理","stage":"DONE","category":"management","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/cross-cultural-management","rating":{"composite":3.65,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.32,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"跨文化团队管理-简介\">跨文化团队管理 简介</h1><p>跨文化团队管理是在全球化背景下，技术团队管理者必须掌握的核心能力。随着远程工作的普及和企业国际化战略的推进，越来越多的技术团队由来自不同文化背景的成员组成。如何理解文化差异、促进有效沟通、协调全球化团队并建设包容性的团队文化，已成为技术管理者面临的重要课题。</p>\n<p>本知识库面向有一定管理经验的中高级技术管理者和团队负责人，适合管理跨国团队、远程分布式团队或多元文化团队的技术领导者。读者应具备基本的团队管理经验。</p>\n<p>全书分为四章，从理论认知到实践落地覆盖跨文化管理的完整知识体系：</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>文化维度理论</strong>介绍霍夫斯泰德文化维度、Trompenaars 模型和文化智商等核心理论框架，帮助读者建立系统的文化认知工具。第二章<strong>跨文化沟通</strong>聚焦高低语境沟通风格、语言障碍处理和远程跨文化协作等实际沟通挑战。第三章<strong>全球化团队管理</strong>讲解分布式团队管理、时区协调和跨文化绩效反馈等管理实务。第四章<strong>文化融合实践</strong>探讨跨文化入职、冲突解决和团队文化构建等落地实践。</p>\n<p>建议读者先建立文化维度的理论框架，再通过沟通和管理章节掌握实用技能，最后在文化融合实践中将知识应用于团队建设。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cultural-dimensions","title":"文化维度理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/cross-cultural-management/cultural-dimensions","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hofstede-model","title":"霍夫斯泰德文化维度模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/cross-cultural-management/cultural-dimensions/hofstede-model"},{"seq":2,"slug":"trompenaars-model","title":"特朗皮纳斯文化维度模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/cross-cultural-management/cultural-dimensions/trompenaars-model"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cultural-intelligence","title":"文化智力与跨文化适应能力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/cross-cultural-management/cultural-dimensions/cultural-intelligence"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"cross-cultural-communication","title":"跨文化沟通","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/cross-cultural-management/cross-cultural-communication","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"communication-styles","title":"跨文化沟通风格","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/cross-cultural-management/cross-cultural-communication/communication-styles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"language-barriers","title":"语言障碍与多语言协作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/cross-cultural-management/cross-cultural-communication/language-barriers"},{"seq":3,"slug":"virtual-communication","title":"虚拟跨文化沟通与远程协作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/cross-cultural-management/cross-cultural-communication/virtual-communication"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"global-team-management","title":"全球化团队管理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/cross-cultural-management/global-team-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"distributed-teams","title":"分布式全球团队管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/cross-cultural-management/global-team-management/distributed-teams"},{"seq":2,"slug":"timezone-workflow","title":"时区管理与全球工作流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/cross-cultural-management/global-team-management/timezone-workflow"},{"seq":3,"slug":"performance-feedback","title":"跨文化绩效反馈与评估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/cross-cultural-management/global-team-management/performance-feedback"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"cultural-integration","title":"文化融合实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/cross-cultural-management/cultural-integration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"onboarding-inclusion","title":"跨文化入职与包容性建设","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/cross-cultural-management/cultural-integration/onboarding-inclusion"},{"seq":2,"slug":"conflict-resolution","title":"跨文化冲突解决","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/cross-cultural-management/cultural-integration/conflict-resolution"},{"seq":3,"slug":"team-culture-building","title":"跨文化团队文化建设","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/cross-cultural-management/cultural-integration/team-culture-building"}]}]}